1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Nobody tells you this about
making friends after 30.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,500
It's not charisma.
It's not confidence.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
It's follow-up.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,500
You already meet people
you like. At work. At the gym. At events.

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,500
Then you both say
“we should hang out” and neither of you texts.

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:20,500
The friendship didn't fail. It just never got a second interaction.

7
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:25,000
Send one message this week
to someone you already met. That's the whole skill.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Try the 7-day plan. Link in bio.
